			"othercredits"
			{
				"english"		"Solo Musicians:\r\nCasey Chavoustie - Snaps, whispers and goblin sounds (tracks 8, 31, 43)\r\nJasmine Cooper - Additional vocal harmonies arranged and performed (track 44)\r\nMatthew Harnage - Additional acoustic guitar (track 29)\r\nJohn Paul Hayward - Solo cello (tracks 1, 3, 18, 30, 50)\r\nOren Kadosh - Vocals (track 19)\r\nGregory Orosz - Solo alto flute (tracks 1, 9, 18, 35, 50)\r\nPatti Rudisill - Solo violin (track 10)\r\nJesse Starr - Bass guitar performed and mixed (tracks 9, 37); Vocals mixed (track 50)\r\nxMEIYIN - Vocals and lyrics (tracks 1, 35, 50)\r\n\r\nORCHESTRA (“Main Theme of Chained Echoes,” “Crimson Wings Spreading Through the Blue Sky”)\r\nPiccolo, Flute, Clarinet: Gregory Orosz\r\nOboe: Brooke Ferd\r\nBassoon: Bassoonify\r\nHorn, Trumpet, Trombone: JohnStacy\r\nPiano: Dallas Hayward\r\nViolin, Viola: Andrew Steffen – The Ethereal String Orchestra\r\nCello, Cello Solo: John Paul Hayward\r\nBass: Travis Kindred\r\n\r\nCHOIR (“Crimson Wings Spreading Through the Blue Sky”)\r\nSoprano: Arcadia Payne, Lexi Davis, Mika Holbrook DiFrancesco, Michelle Dean\r\nAlto: April Iund, Jessica Benson\r\nTenor: Adam Griffiths, Kort Zarbock, Mark Hayward\r\nBass: Ben Lobrot, Braden Rymer, Matthew Robertson, Nathan Curtis\r\n \r\nMIDI Transcription by John Paul Hayward\r\nMusician Contracting by Hayward Publishing\r\nAdditional editing and mixing of orchestral and choir recordings by John Paul Hayward\r\n\r\nMusic by Eddie Marianukroh\r\n\r\nArtwork by Matthias Linda\r\nMixed by Eddie Marianukroh\r\nMastered by Jesse Starr\r\n"
